#. TRANSLATORS: Description for quit command in pkgcli help
#: client/pkgc-manage.c:1147
msgid "Safely stop the PackageKit daemon"
msgstr "Varno ustavi prikriti proces PackageKit"

#: client/pkgc-monitor.c:384
